<title>USA: Hutchinson USD 308, Kan., won by UMB Bank.</title>
<headline>Hutchinson USD 308, Kan., won by UMB Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>UMB Bank said it won $2.700 million of Hutchinson USD 308, Kan., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.62 percent.</p>
</text>
